    "title": "Truth White Insight 611 12",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Patible with 100 kg over bluefin tuna and large yellowfin tuna.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">1pc rod with further enhanced breaking strength, short length model aim for over 100kg in the Strait!</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">It enables you to fight for a long time while continuing to give pressure and long-distance castability required for outstanding line omission and invitation.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Guideline for models to be used by size of tuna～30km OceanSprinter844 / 856 WhiteInsight828～50km OceanSprinter856/838/8110 WhiteInsight828/801050 km ~ WhiteInsight828/8010/7210/7610/61112Torrent waters: WhiteInsight 7210/7610/61112</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">·\tLength: 6ft 11inch（2m11㎝）</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">·\tWeight: 475g</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">·\tTip Dia. / Butt Dia. : 3.2mm / 14mm</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">·\tPe: PE8-12</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">·\tLure: 80-250g</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">·\tGuide: All Stainless PMNST16/PMNSG16/PMNSG20/PMNSG25/PMNSG30/PMNSG40</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">The rear grip is set to be about 20mm longer than the Ocean Sprinter 838/8110, and it is also compatible with style belts that specialize in long-term fights with tuna. It is about 505mm from the reel foot center to the end. Recommended size Yellowfin tuna 100 kg~Yellowfin tuna compatible models (reference)</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">·\t~ 30 km : OceanSprinter844 / 856 WhiteInsight828</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">·\t~ 50 km : OceanSprinter856 / 838 / 8110 WhiteInsight828 / 8010</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">·\t50 kg ~ : WhiteInsight828 / 8010 / 7210 / 7610 / 61112Proto</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">·\tTorrent sea area: WhiteInsight 7210/7610/61112 Proto</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">(It does not mean that WI828 is stronger than OS838, but it is a guideline based on the balance between longer fight time and drag tension)</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"> </p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"></p>",
